# MAJOR: dispatch-cross-check mega-bundle - 26 real FourCC actor
# vtable bodies (lbl_804AC4D0/C588/C658/C6B0/C708/C760/C7B8/C810/C868/
# CA00/CB40/CB98/CBF0/CC68/CCC0/CD18/D1C8/D220/D278/D348/D48C/D5B8/
# D6F0/D858/DAC8/DFE8, ctors already landed) plus shared helper/update
# functions, landed as ONE byte-contiguous 279-function, 175,440-byte
# (~171KB) Track-A bundle (0x80341A00-0x8036C750) - the LARGEST single
# landing in this project's history, surpassing the original
# 149-function mega-bundle. Absorbed the rest of the naively-clustered
# "23-actor" region plus the ENTIRE "16-actor" region in one
# fully-contiguous run. Found+verified via spanwalk.py (extended past
# its default 200-function cap via a direct walk() call with
# max_funcs=1000, stopping exactly at the pre-existing
# extab_8036c750.s boundary) and resolvefiles.py (3 fused-dump
# functions). See project_fsa_dispatch_crosscheck_discovery.md.

